5,1,1,talk,Rin,,I hate walking past the corner in August. It smells terrible. What are we actually going to do about it?,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,"I agree, Rin. It’s unpleasant for everyone. Before we pick a fix, can we look at what this corner actually costs us each year?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Fair point, Midori. But I’m more worried about us still being able to talk to each other after this. Let’s keep that in mind.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,"I’m all for harmony, but I need to know the actual time cost. Who is doing the work, and how many hours does it eat?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I want to know who has been carrying this burden at their gate for years. We need to check the complaint log to see the real history.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, checking the log sounds good, but I really want to know what living next to these options is like every single day.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@May, I hear you. Let’s check the block ledger to see the yearly costs, and the ward subsidy to see what help we might get.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Midori, the ledger is good, but I want to see the ward complaint log too. We need to know who has been suffering the most before we decide anything.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, the log is history, not a plan. I need the truck arrival time and the supervised mornings to calculate the actual hours this will take from us.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Rin, I understand your worry, but we must verify the facts first. I will check the complaint log and the frontage measurements to see who is truly disadvantaged.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
