35,2,1,talk,Rin,,"@Midori, I found the bin house smells worse than the open pile. @May, the supervised mornings are only fifty minutes each.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, that’s a relief. I found the ward subsidy covers forty percent, capped at ninety thousand yen, and last year’s shelters averaged two hundred forty-eight thousand.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, the truck arrives between seven forty and eight fifteen. @Rin, those supervised mornings average fifty minutes each.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, that confirms my findings. The truck window is tight, and the supervised mornings average fifty minutes each.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, the truck time is irrelevant to my concern. I found the complaint log lists this point fourteen times, and eleven were filed by the household at the gate.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, that’s a lot of complaints from one house. @Midori, with the subsidy capped, can we really afford a permanent structure?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, honestly, no. The subsidy covers only forty percent, capped at ninety thousand yen, while the shelters averaged two hundred forty-eight thousand. We’d still owe a lot.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Asuka, eleven complaints from one gate is a red flag. @Shunichi, I need to know if the neighbors are actually willing to enforce any of these rules.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, you’re talking to yourself. I found the truck arrives between seven forty and eight fifteen. That’s before most of us wake up, making strict windows impossible.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, I found the frontage measurements. One house has a driveway blocking most of its width, and the narrowest leaves only ninety centimetres of pavement.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, ninety centimetres is tiny. @Midori, if the structure is too expensive, maybe we just need a better rotation?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, a rotation might work, but the ledger shows we spend thirty-four thousand yen yearly just on bags left open. We need a plan that stops that waste.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, the truck time is brutal. @Asuka, the narrow frontage makes rotation risky. I found the residents’ meeting statements: three people refused to turn away late bags.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""May"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, that’s the problem. If nobody enforces it, the rotation fails. I need to know who actually does the work.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, the refusal to enforce is exactly why the gate household filed eleven complaints. They are tired of cleaning up after everyone else.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, that’s scary. If nobody enforces it, the rotation fails. @May, so the truck time makes strict windows impossible?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, yes, the timing is tight. But @Asuka, the ledger shows we waste thirty-four thousand yen yearly on open bags. We need a solution that stops that leak, not just moves the problem.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, exactly. The minutes show they argued over sweeping within two years. We need a plan that doesn’t rely on us becoming police.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, I found the supervised mornings average fifty minutes each. That’s manageable, but the truck window is the real killer.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, the refusal to enforce is exactly why the gate household filed eleven complaints. They are tired of cleaning up after everyone else.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
