60,3,1,talk,Rin,,"@Midori, the bin house smells worse than the open pile. @May, the truck arrives before we wake up. What are our actual options now?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, the options are A: Managed Collection Hours, B: Rotating Location, and C: Enclosed Structure. We need to vote on which one works best for us.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@Midori, Option C is out. The subsidy is too small, and the bin house smells worse. We are left with A or B.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, Option A is a trap. The truck arrives before we wake, and nobody will enforce the window. I’m leaning toward B, despite the frontage issues.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, Option B is dangerous. The narrowest frontage is only ninety centimetres, and one house has a driveway. We cannot rotate into a space that physically cannot hold the bins.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, ninety centimetres is too tight for B. @May, if A is impossible, what is left? I just want a corner that doesn’t smell.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, I hear you. But @May, if A is impossible and B is physically risky, are we truly left with only C?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Midori, C is financially impossible. We are stuck. We need a plan that doesn’t break the bank or the neighbors.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,May,,"@Midori, I’m not saying A is impossible, just that the timing is brutal. But if B is physically impossible and C is too expensive, maybe we have to pick the least bad option.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@May, the ninety-centimetre frontage makes B physically impossible for that household. We cannot force bins into a driveway. I am voting for A, despite the timing, because it is the only feasible option.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, I’m worried A will just make the smell worse if we can’t enforce it. But if B is impossible, I guess I have to pick A too.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Midori,,"@Rin, I understand your fear. But with C too expensive and B physically impossible, A is our only realistic path. I will vote for A.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Asuka, I agree A is the only feasible choice. But I worry about the social cost. We need a way to enforce it without becoming the police.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, I know the timing is brutal, but B is physically impossible and C is too expensive. I’m voting for A, hoping the rotation keeps us honest.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, the rotation is the only way to share the burden fairly. I am voting for A, but the turn order must be strict.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, I’m voting for A. I just hope the smell doesn’t get worse.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Midori,,"@Shunichi, I’m voting for A too. It’s the only one that fits our budget, even if the timing is tight.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, I’m voting for A. It’s the only option that doesn’t bankrupt us or break the lane. Let’s hope the rotation keeps the peace.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, I’m voting for A. It’s the only one that doesn’t bankrupt us or break the lane. Let’s hope the rotation keeps the peace.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Asuka,,"@Shunichi, I am voting for A. The rotation is the only way to ensure the burden is shared fairly, and I will hold the turn order strict.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
